p['steps']=[step('access','Expose the exhaust mounts','Release and lift the tethered sub-seat, remove the main-seat bolts and slide the seat rearward. Remove the right side-cover bolts and collars, then slide the cover out of its upper/lower locating slots. Retain all hardware by location. No fuel-system work is needed.',[123,124,125,126],'Right side exposed; tabs and hardware retained.'),step('silencer-remove','Remove the complete silencer','Support the silencer. Loosen its joint clamp, remove its two mounting bolts and lift the complete silencer off its joint. Keep the silencer body, end cap and packing assembled.',[206],'Complete silencer supported and removed; internals untouched.'),step('midpipe-remove','Remove the intermediate pipe','Loosen the pipe-2 joint clamp and remove the exhaust-pipe bracket bolt while supporting the pipe. Move pipe 2 through the clearance path shown in PDF211 and remove it without forcing nearby components.',[206,211],'Pipe 2 removed; mounting hardware retained.'),step('header-remove','Remove the header and old seals','Remove the header nuts and header pipe. Leave the header protector attached. Remove the old head gasket and the two pipe-joint gaskets; inspect joint faces and supports for damage before refitting.',[206],'Header removed; all three separated joint seals identified; protector untouched.'),step('header-install','Seat the new header gasket','Install the new gasket at the head and refit header pipe 1. Tighten all header nuts first to 7 N·m, then retighten them to 10 N·m. Do not apply the protector-screw locking-agent note to these nuts.',[206,212],'New head gasket; all header nuts 7 then 10 N·m.',True),step('midpipe-install','Locate pipe 2 and its clamp','Install the new pipe-joint gaskets in their PDF206 positions. Refit the pipe-2 clamp, pipe 2 and bracket bolt. At each joint, engage the clamp projection in the pipe/silencer slot and keep the clamp off the raised projection illustrated in PDF212. Leave final bracket and clamp tightening until the silencer is seated.',[206,212],'Fresh joint seals seated; clamp locating features correct.'),step('silencer-install','Refit the complete silencer','Refit the silencer clamp and complete silencer on the seated joint. Install the retained mounting hardware and tighten both silencer mounting bolts to 30 N·m.',[206,212,213],'Both silencer mounts 30 N·m; joints fully engaged.',True),step('joints-final','Tighten the bracket and both clamps','Confirm front and rear joints remain fully inserted while tightening the exhaust-pipe bracket bolt to 20 N·m, pipe-2 clamp bolt to 16 N·m and silencer clamp bolt to 16 N·m.',[213],'Bracket 20 N·m; each joint clamp 16 N·m; projections correctly located.',True),step('body-close','Restore bodywork and check the installation','Slide the right-cover tabs into their slots with its rib under the rear-fender rib; refit its collars/bolts at 7 N·m. Refit the main seat and its two bolts at 13 N·m. Secure the sub-seat quick fastener with its tether untwisted. Check exhaust support, gasket/joint seating and clearance from bodywork. Record the replaced seals and final torques; this completes removal/refit only, not silencer repacking.',[123,124,125,126,206,213],'Body secure; supported exhaust with clearances and joint seating checked; hardware accounted for.',True)]
